    "previous_model_response": "Since \\(BC \\parallel PQ\\), triangles \\(\\triangle ABC\\) and \\(\\triangle APQ\\) are similar. Thus,\n\n\\[\n\\frac{AC}{AQ}=\\frac{AB}{AP}=\\frac{2}{5}.\n\\]\n\nGiven \\(AC=20\\text{ cm}\\),\n\n\\[\n\\frac{20}{AQ}=\\frac{2}{5}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad AQ=50\\text{ cm}.\n\\]\n\nTherefore,\n\n\\[\nCQ=AQ-AC=50-20=30\\text{ cm}.\n\\]\n\nC: 30 cm"
  },
